# Language

- **English only** for source code, identifiers, comments, commit messages, PR text, root `README.md`, `DEPLOY.md`, specs (`docs/specs/`), skills (`.cursor/skills/`), rules, and `AGENTS.md`.
- User-facing UI copy may be localized later; until then prefer English in the app as well.
- Do not add Danish (or other) prose in repo files unless explicitly requested for a specific document.
